## zen-hub (this build)

zen-hub is a personal, single-user fork of OpenCodeProxyHub at commit 7c3ea8a.
It keeps the upstream protocol implementation (Zen wire identity, tool gating,
streaming converters) and changes the operational shape:

- loopback-only default binding, port 8790 with automatic fallback
- single UPSTREAM_PROXY egress override, direct connection by default
- first-run admin password generation, optional AUTH_MODE=off
- live free-catalog reconciliation that retires ids upstream stopped serving
- a gate probe (scripts/compat.mjs) that reports when the upstream
  client-binding contract changes

